	(text "Both outputs are pseudo open-drain (A=GND, OE drives) with pull-ups to +3V3, so the\ndaughterboard never sees 5 V on /RESET or MIDI (some DBs have 3.3 V inputs).\n/RESET: low while ISA RESET is high.  MIDI: same data as the MIDI-out jack (MPU-401 UART)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 104.14 23.495 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "cce21aba-64ad-5c82-8844-bf98ece93c7b")
	)
